docs {
  # API Root Information
  
  Returns general information about the Monolenz API, including available endpoints and version information.
  
  ## Response (200 OK)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "API information retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "name": "Monolenz API",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "description": "Resume and portfolio management platform",
      "endpoints": {
        "v1": "/api/v1",
        "health": "/health",
        "docs": "/api/docs"
      },
      "timestamp": "2024-01-16T15:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  
  - This endpoint does not require authentication
  - Use this endpoint to discover available API versions and endpoints
  - The `health` endpoint can be used for monitoring and health checks
}

